생기거나'':63 ''생산형'':55 ''성능'':85 ''수'':65,81,106 ''스포츠'':217 ''시스템'':13 ''신규'':15,112 ''야외'':220 ''업데이트'':118 ''오토바이'':10 ''위한'':116 ''위험을'':104 ''이로'':67 ''인한'':92,100 ''인해'':68 ''일부'':45 ''있는'':58 ''있습니다'':54,66,82,107 ''저하'':87 ''전면'':46,59,72,77,83 ''제동'':84 ''조작성'':93 ''주조'':51,56 ''증가시킬'':105 ''차량'':14,221 ''참고'':108 ''추가'':17 ''추가를'':115 ''캘리퍼'':48 ''캘리퍼는'':61 ''타인에게'':98 ''특정'':42 ''파손될'':64 ''파손이'':69 ''회전이'':79', '', 'Sports, recreation, and outdoors, Vehicles', 'Injury hazard', 'A reduction or loss in front braking performance / function or resulting loss in operational handling could increase the risk of an accident-causing injury or death to the rider / pillion or others.', null, 'Owners with an affected vehicle should immediately have the front brake caliper checked professionally at an authorised GASGAS dealership.
Therefore, please contact either your selling dealer or an authorised GASGAS dealer ASAP to make an appointment to have the vehicle recall performed free of charge in accordance with GASGAS technical bulletin requirement.
Also please inform your dealer of your full VIN details to assist with booking arrangements.', null, null, null, null, 'GASGAS Motorcycles', 'Phone: 09 580 5400
