tomers.\\nContact Blumi Baby for further questions relating to the recall or if you have not received your refund from Blumi Baby using the details below.", "product_name_original": "MagniMates Flexible Magnetic Toy Figures", "recall_cause_original": "These products may not comply with the mandatory standard for toys containing magnets.", "operator_name_original": "supplier: Blumi Baby\\nsellers: Blumi Baby – online", "additional_info_original": "Dates available for sale: 28 January 2026 - 1 March 2026\\nWhere sold: International, Online\\nSupporting documents: Recall advertisement.pdf\\nResponsible regulators: Australian Competition and Consumer Commission", "consumer_action_original": "Stop using the product immediately and keep out of reach of children", "operator_contact_original": "email: support@blumibaby.com\\nwebsite: www.blumibaby.com/pages/product-recall", "product_category_original": "Kids'' toys, Learning and activity toys, Toys that are magnetic", "country_of_origin_original": "China", "hazard_description_original": "These products may not comply with the mandatory standard for toys containing magnets. Risk of serious internal injuries or death if a child swallows more than one high-powered magnet, as the magnets may stick together in the child’s intestine or other digestive tissue. Risk of serious injury or death from choking.\\n\\nAn incident has occurred.", "product_description_original": "Flexible magnetic toy stick figures containing small magnets."}, "detected_at": "2026-04-16T04:36:14.302Z", "changed_fields": [], "source_updated_at": null, "source_updated_raw": null}]', '10005153', 0.85, 'ai_auto', null, null, null, false, 0, 0), (1616, 'EN', '2604-0090', 'Haier 히트 펌프 의류건조기 시정 조치 프로그램', 'Haier Heat Pump Tumble Dryer Corrective Action Programme', '', '', '', '전기 기기 및 장비', '', '', null, null, '제품은 화재 위험을 초래합니다. 정상 사용 중 텀블 드라이어 내부에서 내부
