제품에서 배터리를 제거하지 마세요.구입처에 반품하여 전액 환불을 받으세요.', 'https://xicivtmjfkpuehgsieex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recall-images/AU/2026-20877_1.png', '', '', '', '', 'https://xicivtmjfkpuehgsieex.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/recall-pdfs/AU/2026-20877_1.pdf', '', '', true, null, null, '{"brand": "", "topics": ["전자제품 및 기술", "버튼형/코인 배터리", "가정 및 정원", "장식품, 양초 및 기념품", "어린이 장난감", "기념 장난감"], "contact": {"email": "sales@sweidas.com.au", "phone": "(07) 3274 1171", "website": "http://www.sweidas.com.au"}, "hazards": "어린이는 버튼/코인 배터리를 삼키거나 신체 내부에 넣는 경우 질식, 심각한 내부 화상 부상 또는 사망 위험에 처합니다.\\n\\n어린이가 버튼 또는 코인 배터리를 삼켰거나 삽입했다고 의심되는 경우:\\n\\n * 어린이가 호흡 곤란을 겪고 있으면 Triple Zero (000)로 전화하세요.\\n * 24시간 운영되는 독극물 정보 센터(Poisons Information Centre)에 즉시 13 11 26으로 전화하세요. 그들은 적절한 의료 기관으로 안내할 수 있습니다.\\n\\n조기 대응은 생명을 구할 수 있습니다. 증상이 나타날 때까지 기다리지 마세요.", "sellers": ["Costume Land", "SPAR supermarkets", "The Base Warehouse", "Costumebox.com.au"], "supplier": "SWEIDAS (WHOLESALE) PTY LTD", "praNumber": "2026/20877", "whereSold": ["전국적으로", "온라인"], "productName": "Halloween 점등 장식", "publishedDate": "16 April 2026", "consumerActions": ["제품 사용을 즉시 중단하고 어린이의 손이 닿지 않는 곳에 보관하세요.", "제품에서 배터리를 제거하지 마세요.", "구입처에 반품하여 전액 환불을 받으세요."], "productFeatures": "걸이형 광대 머리", "reasonForRecall": "배터리 칸은 나사로 고정되어 있습니다. 그 나사는 걸쇠에 영구적으로 부착되어 있지 않아, 나사가 분실되거나 제거되면 배터리에 접근할 수 있게 됩니다.\\n\\n제품에는 다음에 대한 경고 정보가 포함되어 있지 않습니다:\\n\\n * 어린이에 대한 버튼/코인 배터리의 위험\\n * 누군가가 버튼/코인 배터리를 삼키거나 신체 일부에 넣었다고 의심될 때 취해야 할 조치", "modelIdentifiers": "HW5205; SKU HW5205; UPC 9 339326 054956", "productDescription": "걸이형 광대 머리", "ManufacturerCountry": "중국", "brand_name_original": "", "model_name_original": "HW5205; SKU HW5205; UPC 9 339326 054956", "supportingDocuments": ["Recall Advertisement.pdf"], "where_sold_original": "Nationally, Online", "hazard_type_original": "Children are at risk of choking, severe internal burn injuries or death if they swallow or place button/coin batteries inside their bodies.\\n\\nIf you suspect a child has swallowed or inserted a button or coin battery:\\n\\n * Call Triple Zero (000) if a child is having any difficulty breathing.\\n * Call the Poisons Information Centre immediately on 13 11 26, available 24 hours a day. They can direct you to an appropriate medical facility.\\n\\nEarly action can save lives. Do not wait for symptoms to develop.", "remedy_type_original": "Do not remove the batteries from the product.\\nReturn it to the place of purchase for a full refund.", "datesAvailableForSale": "7 June 2022 - 27 October 2025", "product_name_original": "Halloween light up decoration", "recall_cause_original": "The battery compartment is secured with a screw. The screw is not permanently attached to the latch, so if the screw is lost or removed, the battery could become accessible.\\n\\nThe product does not include warning information about:\\n\\n * the dangers of button/coin batteries to children\\n * what to do when a person suspects someone has swallowed or placed a button/coin battery inside any part of their body.", "responsibleRegulators": "Consumer and Business Services (SA) (사우스오스트레일리아 소비자 및 사업 서비스)", "operator_name_original": "supplier: SWEIDAS (WHOLESALE) PTY LTD\\nsellers: Costume Land, SPAR supermarkets, The Base Warehouse and Costumebox.com.au.", "additional_info_original": "Dates available for sale: 7 June 2022 - 27 October 2025\\nWhere sold: Nationally, Online\\nSupporting documents: Recall Advertisement.pdf\\nResponsible regulators: Consumer and Business Services (SA)", "consumer_action_original": "Stop using the product immediately and keep it out of reach of children.", "operator_contact_original": "phone: (07) 3274 1171\\nemail: sales@sweidas.com.au\\nwebsite: http://www.sweidas.com.au", "product_category_original": "Electronics and technology,Button batteries,Home and garden,Decorations, candles and novelties,Kids'' toys,Novelty toys", "country_of_origin_original": "China", "hazard_description_original": "The battery compartment is secured with a screw. The screw is not permanently attached to the latch, so if the screw is lost or removed, the battery could become accessible. The product does not include warning information about: \\n\\n * the dangers of button/coin batteries to children\\n * what to do when a person suspects someone has swallowed or placed a button/coin battery inside any part of their body. Children are at risk of choking, severe internal burn injuries or death if they swallow or place button/coin batteries inside their bodies. \\n\\nIf you suspect a child has swallowed or inserted a button or coin battery:\\n\\n * Call Triple Zero (000) if a child is having any difficulty breathing.\\n * Call the Poisons Information Centre immediately on 13 11 26, available 24 hours a day. They can direct you to an appropriate medical facility.\\n\\nEarly action can save lives. Do not wait for symptoms to develop.", "product_description_original": "Hanging clown head", "responsible_regulators_original": "Consumer and Business Services (SA)"}', '2026-04-16 06:39:57.889959+00', '2026-06-18 04:44:16.988642+00', '2026-04-16 15:39', '''-2025'':23 ''000'':166 ''054956'':15 ''10월'':25 ''11'':183 ''13'':182 ''2022년'':20 ''24'':186 ''26'':184 ''27일'':26 ''339326'':14 ''6월'':21 ''7일'':22 ''9'':13 ''a'':67,110,118,152,158,168,188 ''about'':98 ''accessible'':90 ''action'':200 ''an'':195 ''any'':122,172 ''appropriate'':196 ''are'':128 ''at'':129 ''attached'':74 ''available'':185 ''base'':38 ''batteries'':103,145 ''battery'':62,87,120,162 ''become'':89 ''bodies'':148 ''body'':126 ''breathing'':174 ''burn'':135 ''button'':159 ''button/coin'':102,119,144 ''call'':163,175 ''can'':191,201 ''centre'':179 ''child'':153,169 ''children'':105,127 ''choking'':132 ''coin'':161 ''compartment'':63 ''costume'':33 ''costumebox.com.au'':40 ''could'':88 ''dangers'':100 ''day'':189 ''death'':138 ''decoration'':7 ''develop'':210 ''difficulty'':173 ''direct'':192 ''do'':108,204 ''does'':93 ''early'':199 ''facility'':198 ''for'':207 ''halloween'':4 ''has'