ched to the back of the vehicle."}, "detected_at": "2026-04-16T08:25:48.158Z", "changed_fields": [], "source_updated_at": null, "source_updated_raw": null}]', null, 0, 'ai_auto', null, null, null, true, 0, 0), (1629, 'JP_RECALLPLUS', 'JP-recall-plus 55596', 'Honda Rebel 250 외 총 2차종', 'ホンダ Rebel 250 他 計2車種', 'Honda', '8BK-MC49, 8BK-MC57', '차명:
